    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a captivating visual novel where you weave a passionate tale of love, desire, and self-discovery. Play as a skilled photo editor, refining stunning images to make ends meet while saving for better computer hardware. Question your career, explore photography as a new venture, and navigate a web of romantic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680160/extras/2594e4a6311c57c026b533dd4a332e23.avif?t=1754507219\" width=603 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of alluring women, each with their own dreams and desires. Flirt, date, and ignite steamy connections filled with NSFW moments that pulse with intensity. Build deep relationships, choose who to pursue, and watch your decisions ripple through a rich, branching narrative. Support your heartbroken Landlady as she heals, and uncover her hidden depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680160/extras/bec51ed112cc19da8218e5c40308d185.avif?t=1754507219\" width=602 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gorgeous artwork and fluid animations, every scene pulls you into a world of romance and tough choices. Will you follow your heart, surrender to temptation, or carve a new path? Craft your story, chase your future, and embark on an unforgettable journey where your choices shape the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-quality graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.000+</strong> images </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+</strong> Animations</p></li>